CODEGEN.md §1.3, §3.5, decision 182: a @go(name:) names public API, so a lower-case override of an enum member is not an exported identifier.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A tone.
enum Tone { a @go(name: "toneA"), b }

emit go { out: "@features/a", package: "a" }
